\newlabel{fig:S4}{{13}{12}{Results of the ROC curves for the Simulation-4 injection campaign encoding physics not included in the template bank used to construct the TT-SNR Map. The signals are injected in Gaussian noise polluted with sine-Gaussian glitches.\relax }{figure.caption.24}{}}
